# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=react,node
# NOTE: Currently identical to the `.cursorignore` file. If you change one, consider changing the other

### Sandbox-leaked HOME (defensive safety net) ###
# A sandboxed agent run with a relative HOME (e.g. HOME=.home) and
# --chdir <workspace> materializes a fake home in the repo root from
# $HOME-relative writes (Go build cache, vrooli CLI metrics, tool config).
# The root cause is guarded in agent-manager + workspace-sandbox; this
# entry prevents an accidental commit if it ever recurs.
/.home/

### Kubernetes configs ###
k8s/kubeconfig-*.yaml
k8s/ca-certificate.crt
k8s/simple-deploy.yaml

